# Edge of the mangled-name limit (#724): a class of 1000 characters with a
# method F(). Epic refuses Function(Param:int) in a class of 976 (3655,
# followup-book2/long-ident-mangled) and admits F() in one of 960. OpenVerse
# does not check a method's mangled name, and prints
#   field 42 | method 1
# If Epic refuses it, the limit counts the class's name and the method's,
# whatever its parameters. Run it alone (single mode).
Class___ := class:
    V:int = 42
    F():int = 1

Main():void =
    Obj := Class___{}
    Print("OVPROBE field {Obj.V}")
    Print("OVPROBE method {Obj.F()}")
